<沿革內容><![CDATA[1.Six articles promulgated by EPA Order (90) Huan-Shu-Shui-Tzu No. 0073680 on November 21, 2001.
2.Revisions to Article 4 promulgated by EPA Order Huan-Shu-Shui-Tzu No. 0980003647 on January 15, 2009.
3.Revisions to Articles 1, 2, and 4 promulgated by EPA Order Huan-Shu-Tu-Tzu No. 1000010141 on February 10, 2011.
